Version 1.3.0 (2026/10/12)
* The target frame will now use delimited numbers, similar to the boss bar;
  player attribute bars remain undelimited by default because it's only 5 digits
* Added a slash command to make the attribute bars delimited: /iab delimall
* Added a slash command to turn off target frame reaction colors: /iab nocolors

Version 1.2.0 (2026/10/05)
* The target frame health bar will now use unit reaction colors for all units
  (instead of just for neutral and friendly NPCs) to ensure that the target
  frame matches the colors of the in-world health bars and nameplates

Version 1.1.1 (2026/09/30)
* Target frame health numbers will no longer be hidden for invincible NPCs

Version 1.1.0 (2026/09/30)
* The target frame health bars for neutral NPCs (e.g., citizens who have not
  been attacked) and friendly NPCs (e.g., quest givers and merchants) will now
  be colored to reflect their unique status

Version 1.0.0 (2026/09/29)
* Initial version
